[Am]Said "read me my kingdom, [F]tell me what it is"

{comment: Verse 2}
[C]And the twins looked [G]down through the blue-lit glass
[Am]Saw the pits and the [F]pods and the coming path
[C]Said "this is a [G]family, this is a door,
